  "name": "basf-carlo-iftmin-profile",
  "description": "BASF IFTMIN (instruction) -> Carlo v3 SeaHouseShipment. Covers create, update, cancel, FCL, LCL and master-sub; the mapping emits one seaHouseShipment entry per IFTMIN message in the interchange. Seq 2 is the 'GET dossier by CustomerRef' lookup: a dataDelivery step that extends the payload with the response under 'lookup' rather than replacing it, which is what lets each BL of a master-sub address its own dossier. See config/README.md check 6 and docs/carlo/06-dossier-lookup.md.",
